theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 19
text = "For this mini-game there will be a question at the top of the screen
and correlating answers will be buttons you can push. If you guess
the correct answer then the potion will turn or stay green. However, 
if you get the question wrong the potion will turn red until you get
the question right. Everytime you get a question right a new question
will appear at the top of the screen and the answer you clicked will 
be replaced with a different answer for a leter question until you get
a certain number of the questions correct."

